{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106049","id":2496668291,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6U0CKD","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106049","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106049.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106049.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106049","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106049/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106049/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106049/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/66faae4d83d18e660695a28458b7f925a0fd58f7","number":106049,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix Set focus on right control on user action \"show in file system\"","user":{"login":"nklbdev","id":7024016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMjQwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7024016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/nklbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Problem\r\n\r\nPreviously, when using the \"Show in File System\" action (e.g., from the 3D viewport), the target file would be selected in the File System dock, but keyboard focus remained on the dock's header instead of moving to the file list/tree.\r\n\r\nThis forced an extra manual step: after triggering the action via shortcut, users had to click the file again before they could use shortcuts like \"Open in external program\" or \"Open in terminal\".\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nThis PR ensures that focus automatically moves to the File System dock's content area (tree/list view) when \"Show in File System\" is triggered.\r\n\r\nBut it does this only when calling the `navigate_to_path` method. When calling the internal `_navigate_to_path` method, the behavior remains the same.\r\n\r\n## Result\r\n\r\nNow, the workflow is seamless:\r\n\r\n- Select a resource (e.g., in the 3D viewport).\r\n- Press \"Show in File System\" shortcut (focus moves to the file list).\r\n- Immediately use \"Open in external program\" shortcut or other actions without extra clicks.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/215f81b2-cdfa-4414-87b2-7843d7e1c486)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"ht